# Database dumps written by `php artisan db:backup` (v7.41). This MUST stay
# ignored: a dump is the entire database — every guest name, email, phone,
# address, booking and payment record — and committing one publishes all of it to
# everyone with repository access, permanently, because git keeps every revision.
# Copy backups somewhere off this machine instead; see project.md §15.9.
